# Risk Assessment Full-Deck Review — May 28, 2026

## Overview
All 38 Memento flashcards from the DABT - Risk Assessment collection reviewed in a single sitting (rapid-fire mode). First-pass learning on a deck created May 26, 2026, with 8 cards previously covered in a verbal-only session (May 27).

